  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/636/armor-stand-arms-header.png\" width=\"1857\" height=\"140\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>說明</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您的原版體驗將透過輕鬆快速地為所有盔甲架添加手臂的功能而進一步提升。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">只需靠近您已放置的盔甲架，並使用指令 <em><strong>/trigger armorstandarms</strong></em>&nbsp; 即可為您生成手臂。請確保您與盔甲架的距離在 3 個方塊以內。&nbsp; <em>此功能於伺服器端運作，連線至伺服器遊玩時客戶端無需安裝。</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/637/armor-stand-arms-screenshot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"592\"><br></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就申請伺服器與朋友一起遊玩吧！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方的橫幅 &amp; 使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享有 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
